{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceLinkInvariance","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTraceLinkInvariance","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.IwahoriHeckeAPI"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IwahoriHeckeAPI.IwahoriHeckeAlgebra.markovTrace_conj_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IwahoriHeckeAPI.IwahoriHeckeAlgebra.markovTrace_conj_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/MarkovTraceLinkInvariance.lean#L60-L72","doc":"**Markov move II — conjugation invariance of the Markov trace.** For any\n`a` and any `b` with a left inverse `binv` (`binv * b = 1`),\n\n  `tr_M(b · a · binv) = tr_M(a)`.\n\nImmediate from cyclicity `tr_M(x y) = tr_M(y x)`:\n`tr_M((b a)·binv) = tr_M(binv·(b a)) = tr_M((binv b)·a) = tr_M(1·a) = tr_M(a)`.\nThe second of the two Markov moves (move I is `markovTrace_stab_comm` in\n`IwahoriHeckeAPI`); together they make `tr_M` a link invariant. Sorry-free. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IwahoriHeckeAPI.IwahoriHeckeAlgebra.jonesOfBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IwahoriHeckeAPI.IwahoriHeckeAlgebra.jonesOfBraid","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/MarkovTraceLinkInvariance.lean#L53-L58","doc":"**Jones value of a positive braid word** `w` (a list of generator indices),\nvia the Markov trace on `H_n(q)`: `J(w) = tr_M(∏_k σ_{w_k})`. The Hecke image\nis the ordered product of the generators named by `w`, built with core\n`List.foldr` (no `BigOperators` dependency). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IwahoriHeckeAPI.IwahoriHeckeAlgebra.instRingCarrier_folio","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IwahoriHeckeAPI.IwahoriHeckeAlgebra.instRingCarrier_folio","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/MarkovTraceLinkInvariance.lean#L48-L51","doc":"Register the carrier's `Ring` (a structure field) as a `local instance`, so\n`*` / `1` / `markov_trace` resolve without `letI` in every statement below.\nLocal to this section: it does not leak past `end IwahoriHeckeAlgebra`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}